- Problem Analysis: The azapi.tf file references identity.value.identity_ids but the module outputs userAssignedIdentities as a map object (not identity_ids). The identity block needs to extract keys from the userAssignedIdentities map. Also, the for_each condition uses can() which doesn't properly check for null values.
- Fix Method: Updated identity dynamic block to use pattern from auth_ssh_multiple test case - changed for_each to use != null check and identity_ids to extract keys from userAssignedIdentities map
- Changes Made: 
  * Line 56: Changed from "can(module.replicator.azapi_header.identity)" to "module.replicator.azapi_header.identity != null"
  * Line 59: Changed from "try(identity.value.identity_ids, null)" to "try(identity.value.userAssignedIdentities, null) != null ? keys(identity.value.userAssignedIdentities) : null"
